<Layout title="Privacy Notice — Draft for Approval" description="Current registration privacy notice for Ankit Jobs & Staffing India. Online collection is disabled pending secure processing and approval of data-handling terms." noindex>
  <PageHero title="Your Information Deserves Care." eyebrow="Privacy notice" text="Draft notice — client and legal approval required before enabling candidate data collection."/>
  <section class="section"><article class="container legal-content"><div class="draft-banner"><strong>Online candidate submission is currently unavailable.</strong><p>This draft is not an approved policy for collecting personal information. The form checks details in your browser only and does not submit them.</p></div><h2>Current website behaviour</h2><p>The candidate form is available for review and local validation. This website does not send completed candidate details to a server, WhatsApp, an email service or analytics. It does not save form entries in localStorage or application logs. Your browser may offer its own autofill features.</p><p>The website uses locally hosted fonts and images. No analytics, advertising or tracking integrations are included. The hosting provider may process ordinary web request information; its identity and applicable handling terms must be confirmed before launch.</p><h2>Information shown in the candidate form</h2><p>The proposed form includes name, father’s name, mother’s name, mobile number, email, qualification, date of birth, calculated age, gender, state, district and an optional alternative mobile number.</p><p>The need to collect family details, date of birth and gender must be reviewed against the intended recruitment purpose before live collection begins.</p><h2>Required approvals before collection</h2><ul><li>The specific purposes and necessity of each requested field.</li><li>The organization responsible for the data and a privacy contact.</li><li>The secure processing provider, storage location and authorized recipients.</li><li>Retention and deletion periods, including backups.</li><li>How candidates can request access, correction, withdrawal or deletion.</li><li>Eligibility and any safeguards needed for younger candidates.</li><li>Applicable privacy obligations and the final consent wording.</li></ul><h2>Contact links and external services</h2><p>Click-to-call, WhatsApp and email links open the service you choose. Those services have their own terms and privacy practices. Please keep enquiries general and do not send candidate family details or sensitive documents using these links.</p><h2>Questions about this notice</h2><p>Contact Ankit Rai at <a href="tel:+918348623389">+91 8348623389</a> or <a href="mailto:ankitjobs99@gmail.com">ankitjobs99@gmail.com</a> for a general enquiry. An approved privacy request procedure has not yet been supplied.</p></article></section>
</Layout>
